### [x] Task 3 — Register chat router in `app/main.py`

In `autom9-backend/app/main.py`, add two lines:

```python
from app.api.chat import router as chat_router   # add this import
```

And in the router registrations block (after `app.include_router(data_router)`):

```python
app.include_router(chat_router)
```

Also add a `ProviderError` exception handler alongside the existing `IntegrationError` handler:

```python
from app.core.exceptions import IntegrationError, ProviderError  # update existing import

@app.exception_handler(ProviderError)
async def provider_error_handler(request: Request, exc: ProviderError) -> JSONResponse:
    return JSONResponse(
        status_code=503,
        content={"error": {"code": "PROVIDER_ERROR", "message": str(exc), "provider": exc.provider}},
    )
```

